                <pb facs="0759" n="609" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg609"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Bonilla to
                        Minister Combs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><placeName type="venue"><hi
                                    rendition="#small-caps">Palace</hi></placeName>, <placeName
                                type="city"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Desiring you to have full knowledge of the incident that has occurred between my
                    Government and that of Nicaragua, and for you to see how justice is on my part
                    in said conflict, I transcribe to you the dispatches exchanged between the
                    general in chief of my troops and President Zelaya, which I omitted doing in my
                    former telegram:</p>
            </div>
